  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Mind and Illusion; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 2,500 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p>On this scroll is scrawled a mind-numbingly complicated formula that, when activated, attempts to erase the reader from the memories of up to 6 people within 200 feet of the user, as per the Amnesia talent of the Mind sphere (Will save negates, DC 15 + casting ability modifier).</p>\n<p>At the same time, an illusion is cast on the user, making them invisible as per the Suppression talent for 10 rounds (+10 Stealth bonus).</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCapture Spell, Illusion sphere, Mind sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,250 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/scrolls#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
